      "id": "claim_f828f1b7a49747a1a4d5d8d8398f63d8",
      "statement": "All check gates run through Bun scripts: `bun run build` = `tsgo --noEmit && expo prebuild -p android` and `bun run ci` = type check + `expo lint` + `oxfmt --check` + prebuild; type checking must use the @typescript/native-preview compiler (`tsgo --noEmit`) — AGENTS.md explicitly forbids plain `tsc` — against a tsconfig that only extends expo/tsconfig.base with `strict` enabled.",
