      "id": "claim_45ca24d5c9e44674aa534036eafa80db",
      "statement": "eas.json defines the build profiles: `preview` builds an APK for internal distribution and is the profile the tag workflow builds; `production` and `dapp-store` set autoIncrement with appVersionSource remote (version authority lives on EAS's side); `dapp-store` builds in the production environment with EAS-managed env bindings for EXPO_PUBLIC_RPC_URL and EXPO_PUBLIC_HELIUS_API_KEY plus EAS_GRADLE_CACHE=1; the CLI requires eas-cli >= 18.0.3.",
